{
  "name": "dypos-server",
  "version": "1.47.2",
  "description": "DyPOS SaaS backend - REST API + JWT Auth + SQLite (node:sqlite, zero native deps)",
  "main": "server.js",
  "type": "module",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.5.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node entrypoint.js",
    "supervise": "node scripts/watchdog.mjs",
    "dev": "node --watch server.js",
    "test": "node scripts/run-tests.mjs",
    "test:dot": "node scripts/run-tests.mjs --reporter dot",
    "test:watch": "node scripts/run-tests.mjs --watch",
    "test:stock-strict": "node --test --import ./tests/setup-strict.js --import ./tests/setup.js tests/stock-guard-strict.test.js",
    "doctor": "node scripts/doctor.mjs",
    "migrate": "node db/migrate.js",
    "seed": "node db/seed.js",
    "seed:royal:sample": "node scripts/seed-royal-production.mjs",
    "e2e:royal": "node scripts/e2e-royal.mjs",
    "e2e:yaqoub": "node scripts/operational-run-yaqoub.mjs",
    "backup": "node scripts/backup.mjs",
    "backup:verify": "node scripts/verify-restore.mjs",
    "load": "node scripts/load-test.mjs",
    "campaign": "node scripts/stress-campaign.mjs",
    "parity": "node scripts/check-pg-parity.mjs",
    "contract": "node scripts/check-method-coverage.mjs",
    "upstream": "node scripts/check-api-upstream.mjs",
    "load:k6": "k6 run -e BASE=http://localhost:3001 tests/load/k6-invoices.js",
    "lint": "biome check .",
    "lint:fix": "biome check --write ."
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@biomejs/biome": "^2.5.14"
  },
  "comment": [
    "Every dependency here is imported by shipped code, a config, a CSS @import",
    "or an npm script. The OpenTelemetry packages went with lib/telemetry.js:",
    "that module was unreachable from any entry point, so the collector wiring it",
    "declared (api, resources, semantic-conventions, instrumentation-express/http,",
    "Prometheus exporter) had no importer either. An SDK plus an exporter that",
    "nothing configures is worse than none — a deployment that enabled OTLP got an",
    "unconfigured collector. Add a package back the moment a code path really",
    "exports traces or OTLP metrics, and wire it in the same commit."
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "bcryptjs": "^3.0.3",
    "better-sqlite3": "^13.0.3",
    "compression": "^1.7.4",
    "cors": "^2.8.5",
    "dotenv": "^18.0.1",
    "express": "^4.21.0",
    "express-rate-limit": "^8.7.0",
    "helmet": "^8.0.0",
    "jsonwebtoken": "^9.0.2",
    "pg": "^8.13.0",
    "pino": "^10.3.1",
    "prom-client": "^15.1.3",
    "qrcode": "^1.5.4",
    "uuid": "^14.0.2",
    "zod": "^3.23.8"
  }
}
